# Generated print artwork. Rebuild with:  python make-qr.py <url>
# Kept out of git for two reasons: the QR a session actually uses is drawn by the
# server at /qr and is not a file, and these encode whichever address the laptop
# had when they were generated — no reason to publish an internal one.
assets/join-qr.svg
assets/join-qr.png
assets/join-qr-card.png

